step Level 36
  when level<36
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Still below 36 after Grom'gol's hand-ins? The Mosh'Ogg Brutes and Witch Doctors camp in the hills just east of the camp: kill them until level 36, pulling one at a time, then walk back to the zeppelin tower. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Armory) or the Razorfen Downs dungeon instead.
